###### <prophe.seed>
..........................
Global remembrance will cause dissolution of boundaries of country. Because we will remember that we are not just the genetic bloodline and cultural lineage we were raised within, the idea of difference between those who are from one country and those who are from another will lose the strength of power.

The result will be that we will no longer have the same kind of hard boundaries between countries and their cultures anymore.

Skin color and origin will cease to be weighed for value, instead we will see the true enemy for its face: colonization, claiming that any piece of land belongs to any given entity. The earth is her own, and we are her guests. 
